# SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
# Omamobile: the GPU's lowest level on the Pixel 9a is 419 MHz, not
# 150 MHz. simple_ondemand looks at the load every 50 ms, so a swipe or an app
# opening after a quiet moment started at 150 MHz, and its first frames were
# late while the governor caught up. Idle, panthor suspends the GPU (about 99 %
# of the time on a lit home screen), so the floor costs nothing there.
ACTION=="add", SUBSYSTEM=="devfreq", KERNEL=="1f000000.gpu", ATTR{min_freq}="419000000"
